  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1831a947-8f34-480e-b8f3-d0ceeaadb2c6"],
 " dimensional computational basis of a composite system (many qudits).",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"75e1f0aa-be1a-4c8d-a271-f233c2007ec9"],
 Cell[BoxData[
